# 触摸丢点诊断开关；仅排查构建启用，正式版保持关闭。
# Touch tap-drop diagnostics; enable only on investigation builds.
menu "Touch diagnostics"

    config TOUCH_DIAG
        bool "Enable touch tap-drop diagnostics logging"
        default n
        help
            阅读翻页偶发无响应排查用：在触摸输入链路（app_loop / ui_gesture /
            app_book / cst836u）输出单行事件日志、阻塞窗口与统计汇总。
            Investigation aid for sporadic dropped page-turn taps: one-line
            event logs, stall windows and stats on the touch input chain.

    config TOUCH_DIAG_BEEP
        bool "Beep when an input event is discarded without action"
        depends on TOUCH_DIAG
        default n
        help
            手势被取消或双击挂起被冲销时短鸣一声，便于不接串口时统计丢失率。
            Short beep when a gesture is cancelled or a pending double-tap is
            dropped, so drop rates can be counted without a serial console.

endmenu

# bring-up 阶段的面板自检；正式固件保持关闭。
# Panel self-test for bring-up; keep disabled in production images.
menu "Bring-up diagnostics"

    config DISPLAY_POWER_DIAG
        bool "Log panel power requests and idle deadlines"
        default n
        help
            排查供电就绪超时和前光下边缘变灰：记录开关电请求、保持时间、
            主循环关电检查延迟，仅在供电失败后额外读取现有状态寄存器。
            Investigate power-ready timeouts and lit edge graying: log power
            requests, hold durations and idle-check lateness, reading extra
            existing status registers only after a power failure.

    config READER_PERF
        bool "Measure reader operation latency and memory"
        default n
        help
            输出阅读操作、阶段耗时、字体缓存及操作内存低水位，供固定场景对比。
            Emit reader operation/stage timing, font cache counters and local
            heap lows for comparisons under fixed conditions.

    config READER_MEMORY
        bool "Record reader resource ownership snapshots"
        depends on READER_PERF
        default n
        help
            在计时结束后遍历各拥有者的存活资源，并记录关闭和退出快照。
            仅用于资源诊断；固定页序的性能对照应关闭，避免遍历影响后续缓存。
            Walk live owner allocations after timing and record close/exit snapshots.
            Enable only for resource diagnostics; disable for fixed-page timing
            comparisons so resource walks do not affect subsequent caches.

    config MOGO_EPD_TEST_PATTERN
        bool "Run EPD test pattern at boot"
        default n
        help
            开机先画灰阶条、棋盘格、细线、四角十字、中心圆和 1 px 边框，
            再做一次 GC16 全刷与 20 次 GL16 局刷，最后停 10 秒。
            Draw gray bars, checkerboard, thin lines, corner crosses, a center
            circle and a 1 px border, then one GC16 full refresh and 20 GL16
            area updates, holding the pattern for 10 seconds.

endmenu

# 联网升级源；保持默认即沿用正式站点，填自建前缀即可接入自己的 OTA 平台。
# Online update sources; keep the defaults for the public sites, or point at a self-hosted platform.
menu "Online update (OTA)"

    config PICO_OTA_FEED_URL
        string "Primary manifest URL"
        default "https://mogo.mantake.shop/api/v2/ota/devices/mogo-e4p/update.json"
        help
            设备优先读取的 JSON 清单地址。必须是 HTTPS，服务器不得重定向，
            响应体不超过 8 KB。
            Primary manifest URL. Must be HTTPS, the server must not redirect,
            and the body must stay under 8 KB.

    config PICO_OTA_FEED_FALLBACK_URL
        string "Fallback manifest URL"
        default "https://wegooo-cell.github.io/read-pico-reader/update.json"
        help
            主源失败后读取的清单地址，要求同上。
            Manifest read when the primary source fails; same requirements.

    config PICO_OTA_EXTRA_ORIGIN
        string "Extra download origin prefix (empty disables)"
        default ""
        help
            允许清单引用的额外下载前缀，必须以斜杠结尾，例如
            https://ota.example.com/files/。前缀之后只允许一个 .bin 文件名，
            不允许查询串或子目录，避免清单把设备引到任意地址。
            Extra download prefix a manifest may reference; must end with a
            slash, e.g. https://ota.example.com/files/. Only one .bin filename
            may follow it, with no query string or subdirectories.

    config PICO_OTA_ALLOW_HTTP
        bool "Allow plain http:// origins (local OTA testing only)"
        default n
        help
            仅用于本地联调：允许清单与下载前缀使用 http://。仍然只接受上面
            配置过的前缀，不会放开任意地址。正式发布必须关闭。
            Local OTA testing only: permits plain http:// origins. Only the
            configured prefixes above are accepted; arbitrary URLs remain
            rejected. Must stay off for production releases.

endmenu
